  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.11.0 - Native terminal hyperlinks. StyledText.Link(label, Uri) and CellStyle.WithHyperlink carry encoded HTTP, HTTPS, file, and mailto targets through styling, wrapping, clipping, Markdown, panes, full-screen rendering, and inline output. HyperlinkMode.Auto/Always/Never controls OSC 8 independently of color. Stable target identity and URI-aware diffing handle wrapped links and target-only updates; unsafe targets and IDs are rejected. The example includes a URI hyperlinks tour page and --links-once. Full release history: https://github.com/jchristn/TUIKit/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
